// the pawn's InteractInfo.ChannelingData (UCharacterSecondaryInfo handle 26, an FChannelingData) of ten harvests: the block that SETS it in the node's wake packet and the block that
// CLEARS it with the result.  A Block is the content block of the pawn's InteractInfo sub-object (a RepLayout block of that one property).  The values are what the generator's own
// reader (tools/ghidra/schema_check.py read_struct) found in the set block: the node's ObjectId, the flags word, the start time (a double: whole seconds), the duration (float bits),
